  <main class="content wrapper clearfix">
    <img src="images/francesco-mari.jpg" class="about-picture">
    <div class="about">
      <p>Hi, I'm Francesco! A software engineer specialized in Backend development, passionate about crafting scalable solutions that deliver high impact and drive business growth.</p>
      <p>My portfolio includes a wide range of applications, including E-commerce, Programmatic Advertising, and Analytics solutions.
        Currently, I'm working with <a href="https://hive.app/" target="_blank">Hive Technologies</a>, a third-party fulfillment platform, where I design and implement E-commerce and logistics backend systems for B2B and D2C applications.
      </p>
      <p>I've been a Linux enthusiast since the golden age of Slackware, which ignited my passion for open-source software and technology.
        I mainly enjoy building Backend systems with Ruby, but I also like tackling challenges across the whole stack when the opportunity arises.</p>

      <p>My values are grounded in ethics, simplicity, and purpose.<br>
        I believe that technology should make our existence better, rather than just making our lives easier.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
